UID:shipshewana-ice-festival-chili-cook-off-20270116@projectscroll.com
DTSTAMP:20261022T082028Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270116
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270117
SUMMARY:Shipshewana Ice Festival & Chili Cook-Off
LOCATION:Shipshewana\, IN
DESCRIPTION:Professional carvers fill the town with ice sculptures\, with live carving and a carving competition\, plus a wing contest on Friday evening and a chili contest on Saturday. Check the dates and times on the event’s own website before you go. More: https://projectscroll.com/seasons/#shipshewana-ice-festival-chili-cook-off
URL:https://visitshipshewana.org/wintertime
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:st-joseph-ice-fest-20270129@projectscroll.com
DTSTAMP:20261022T082028Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270129
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270201
SUMMARY:St. Joseph Ice Fest
LOCATION:St. Joseph\, MI
DESCRIPTION:Downtown St. Joseph fills with ice carvers working through the weekend\, a lit 'Fire & Ice' tower\, frozen games for families and a scavenger hunt along State and Pleasant streets. Check the dates and times on the event’s own website before you go. More: https://projectscroll.com/seasons/#st-joseph-ice-fest
URL:https://www.stjoetoday.com/icefest
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
