DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270206
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270207
SUMMARY:Dowagiac Ice Time Festival
LOCATION:Dowagiac\, MI
DESCRIPTION:A one-day winter festival downtown with ice sculptures\, a chili crawl through local restaurants\, children's crafts\, open shops and a fire-department s'mores tent. Check the dates and times on the event’s own website before you go. More: https://projectscroll.com/seasons/#dowagiac-ice-time-festival
URL:https://www.dowagiacchamber.com/events/upcoming-events
END:VEVENT
