DTSTAMP:20261022T082028Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270205
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270208
SUMMARY:South Haven Ice Breaker Festival
LOCATION:South Haven\, MI
DESCRIPTION:More than forty ice sculptures line downtown South Haven\, alongside cardboard sled races\, horse-drawn wagon rides\, outdoor skating and a chili cook-off. Check the dates and times on the event’s own website before you go. More: https://projectscroll.com/seasons/#south-haven-ice-breaker-festival
URL:https://www.southhaven.org/events/ice-breaker-festival-2/
END:VEVENT
