SUMMARY:Candlelight Christmas Parade
LOCATION:Dowagiac\, MI
DESCRIPTION:Dowagiac's evening holiday parade brings well over a hundred lighted units down Front Street\, with a tree lighting at Beckwith Park\, as part of the town's 'Celebrate the Holidays' season. Check the dates and times on the event’s own website before you go. More: https://projectscroll.com/seasons/#candlelight-christmas-parade
URL:https://www.dowagiacchamber.com/events/upcoming-events
