DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261214
SUMMARY:Santa's Candy Cane Express at Hesston Steam Museum
LOCATION:Hesston (near La Porte)\, IN
DESCRIPTION:The steam museum's Christmas trains carry families through the snowy woods to visit Santa on two December weekends. Check the dates and times on the event’s own website before you go. More: https://projectscroll.com/seasons/#santa-s-candy-cane-express-at-hesston-steam-museum
