DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270308
SUMMARY:Kalamazoo Nature Center Maple Sugar Festival
LOCATION:Kalamazoo\, MI
DESCRIPTION:A day in the sugarbush at the Nature Center\, with a pancake breakfast served with Michigan maple syrup and horse-drawn wagon rides around the grounds. Check the dates and times on the event’s own website before you go. More: https://projectscroll.com/seasons/#kalamazoo-nature-center-maple-sugar-festival
URL:https://naturecenter.org/events/maplesugar/
