DTSTAMP:20261022T082028Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270320
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270322
SUMMARY:Kalamazoo Living History Show
LOCATION:Kalamazoo\, MI
DESCRIPTION:A large juried show for reenactors and history buffs\, where makers sell pre-1890 clothing\, gear and crafts at the county Expo Center\; open to the public\, with a different reenactment group hosting each year. Check the dates and times on the event’s own website before you go. More: https://projectscroll.com/seasons/#kalamazoo-living-history-show
URL:https://www.kalamazooshow.com/
END:VEVENT
