DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270621
SUMMARY:Elkhart Jazz Festival
LOCATION:Elkhart\, IN
DESCRIPTION:Four days of jazz in venues all over downtown Elkhart\, including the historic Lerner Theatre\, outdoor stages and small listening rooms. Check the dates and times on the event’s own website before you go. More: https://projectscroll.com/seasons/#elkhart-jazz-festival
