SUMMARY:LaPorte County Fair
LOCATION:La Porte\, IN
DESCRIPTION:Billed as Indiana's oldest county fair\, with livestock and open-class shows\, rodeo and grandstand events\, and Pioneerland\, a living-history village of early Indiana pioneer life. Check the dates and times on the event’s own website before you go. More: https://projectscroll.com/seasons/#laporte-county-fair
URL:https://lpfair.com/
END:VEVENT
