SUMMARY:Cass County Fair
LOCATION:Cassopolis\, MI
DESCRIPTION:Cass County's agricultural fair\, with livestock shows\, still exhibits and a youth auction\, a carnival\, and grandstand rodeos\, tractor pulls and demolition derbies. Check the dates and times on the event’s own website before you go. More: https://projectscroll.com/seasons/#cass-county-fair
