SUMMARY:Giant Straw Bale Art Trail
LOCATION:Shipshewana\, Middlebury\, LaGrange and Howe\, IN
DESCRIPTION:A free self-guided autumn trail of giant round straw bales turned into colorful characters and scenes by local artists and businesses across four towns. Check the dates and times on the event’s own website before you go. More: https://projectscroll.com/seasons/#giant-straw-bale-art-trail
URL:https://visitshipshewana.org/events/autumn-adventures/straw-bale-art/
