UID:christmas-in-cassopolis-20261205@projectscroll.com
DTSTAMP:20261022T082028Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261205
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261206
SUMMARY:Christmas in Cassopolis
LOCATION:Cassopolis\, MI
DESCRIPTION:Santa and crafts at the Marketplace on Broadway\, cookies and cocoa at the VFW\, an elf scavenger hunt that starts at the 1899 courthouse\, caroling down Broadway at 6\, and the tree lit under the arches at Stone Lake Beach just after. Broadway is closed to traffic from York to Water Street. Check the dates and times on the event’s own website before you go. More: https://projectscroll.com/seasons/#christmas-in-cassopolis
URL:https://cassopolismainstreet.com/christmas-in-cassopolis/
